{"seq":1,"slug":"static-analysis-tools","title":"静态分析工具","url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/smart-contract-security/auditing/static-analysis-tools","wordCount":838,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"静态分析工具\">静态分析工具</h1><p>在智能合约审计的工具链中，静态分析器是第一道自动化防线——它们在不执行代码的情况下，通过数据流分析、模式匹配和符号推理检测潜在漏洞。Slither 和 Mythril 分别代表两种互补的技术路线：Slither 基于中间表示（IR）的快速模式匹配，Mythril 基于符号执行的深度路径探索。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>静态分析工具的能力边界由两个维度决定：<strong>覆盖率</strong>（能检测多少漏洞类型）和<strong>精确度</strong>（误报率有多低）。没有单一工具能在两个维度同时最优。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TB&#10;    SOURCE[Solidity源码] --&gt; COMPILE[编译]&#10;    COMPILE --&gt; AST[抽象语法树]&#10;    COMPILE --&gt; IR[中间表示SSA]&#10;    COMPILE --&gt; BYTECODE[EVM字节码]&#10;    AST --&gt; SLITHER[Slither分析]&#10;    IR --&gt; SLITHER&#10;    BYTECODE --&gt; MYTHRIL[Mythril分析]&#10;    SLITHER --&gt; PATTERN[模式匹配检测器]&#10;    SLITHER --&gt; DATAFLOW[数据流追踪]&#10;    SLITHER --&gt; PRINTER[信息提取打印器]&#10;    MYTHRIL --&gt; SYMBOLIC[符号执行引擎]&#10;    MYTHRIL --&gt; SMT[SMT约束求解]&#10;    MYTHRIL --&gt; CONCOLIC[混合执行]&#10;    PATTERN --&gt; REPORT1[快速报告 秒级]&#10;    SMT --&gt; REPORT2[深度报告 分钟级]\">flowchart TB\n    SOURCE[Solidity源码] --&gt; COMPILE[编译]\n    COMPILE --&gt; AST[抽象语法树]\n    COMPILE --&gt; IR[中间表示SSA]\n    COMPILE --&gt; BYTECODE[EVM字节码]\n    AST --&gt; SLITHER[Slither分析]\n    IR --&gt; SLITHER\n    BYTECODE --&gt; MYTHRIL[Mythril分析]\n    SLITHER --&gt; PATTERN[模式匹配检测器]\n    SLITHER --&gt; DATAFLOW[数据流追踪]\n    SLITHER --&gt; PRINTER[信息提取打印器]\n    MYTHRIL --&gt; SYMBOLIC[符号执行引擎]\n    MYTHRIL --&gt; SMT[SMT约束求解]\n    MYTHRIL --&gt; CONCOLIC[混合执行]\n    PATTERN --&gt; REPORT1[快速报告 秒级]\n    SMT --&gt; REPORT2[深度报告 分钟级]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>Slither</th>\n<th>Mythril</th>\n<th>组合策略</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>分析方式</td>\n<td>IR模式匹配 + 数据流</td>\n<td>符号执行 + SMT求解</td>\n<td>Slither先筛，Mythril深挖</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>执行速度</td>\n<td>秒级（大型项目&lt;30s）</td>\n<td>分钟到小时级</td>\n<td>串联：快扫→深扫</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>误报率</td>\n<td>中等（需人工复核）</td>\n<td>低（路径可达性验证）</td>\n<td>交叉验证降误报</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>漏报率</td>\n<td>跨合约交互易漏</td>\n<td>路径爆炸限制深度</td>\n<td>互补覆盖</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>检测器数量</td>\n<td>90+ 内置</td>\n<td>20+ 安全属性</td>\n<td>合计覆盖 SWC 80%+</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>自定义扩展</td>\n<td>Python API 编写检测器</td>\n<td>插件系统</td>\n<td>可针对项目定制</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>CI/CD集成</td>\n<td>原生支持</td>\n<td>Docker + JSON输出</td>\n<td>均可进 GitHub Actions</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"slither-深度使用\">Slither 深度使用</h2><p>Slither 由 Trail of Bits 开发维护，是目前使用最广泛的 Solidity 静态分析器。其核心优势在于速度和可扩展性。</p>\n<h3 id=\"关键检测器\">关键检测器</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"# 安装&#10;pip install slither-analyzer&#10;&#10;# 全量扫描&#10;slither . --json report.json&#10;&#10;# 针对性检测高危漏洞&#10;slither . --detect reentrancy-eth,reentrancy-no-eth,\\&#10;  unprotected-upgrade,arbitrary-send-eth,\\&#10;  suicidal,controlled-delegatecall&#10;&#10;# 排除测试文件和依赖&#10;slither . --filter-paths &quot;test|node_modules|lib&quot;&#10;&#10;# 生成继承关系图&#10;slither . --print inheritance-graph\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 安装</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">pip</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> install</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> slither-analyzer</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 全量扫描</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">slither</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> .</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --json</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> report.json</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 针对性检测高危漏洞</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">slither</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> .</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --detect</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> reentrancy-eth,reentrancy-no-eth,</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  unprotected-upgrade,arbitrary-send-eth,</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  suicidal,controlled-delegatecall</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 排除测试文件和依赖</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">slither</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> .</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --filter-paths</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"test|node_modules|lib\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 生成继承关系图</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">slither</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> .</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --print</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> inheritance-graph</span></span></code></pre></div><p>Slither 的检测器按严重程度分级：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"solidity\" data-code=\"// Slither 会标记的高危模式示例&#10;&#10;// 1. reentrancy-eth: ETH 转账前状态未更新&#10;function withdraw() external {&#10;    uint bal = balances[msg.sender];&#10;    (bool ok,) = msg.sender.call{value: bal}(&quot;&quot;); // Slither: 重入风险&#10;    balances[msg.sender] = 0; // 应在 call 之前&#10;}&#10;&#10;// 2. arbitrary-send-eth: ETH 发送目标可被控制&#10;function send(address to, uint amount) external {&#10;    payable(to).transfer(amount); // Slither: 任意ETH发送&#10;}&#10;&#10;// 3. unprotected-upgrade: 升级函数缺少权限检查&#10;function upgradeTo(address newImpl) external {&#10;    _setImplementation(newImpl); // Slither: 未保护的升级&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// Slither 会标记的高危模式示例</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 1. reentrancy-eth: ETH 转账前状态未更新</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>function withdraw() external {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    uint bal = balances[msg.sender];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    (bool ok,) = msg.sender.call{value: bal}(\"\"); // Slither: 重入风险</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    balances[msg.sender] = 0; // 应在 call 之前</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 2. arbitrary-send-eth: ETH 发送目标可被控制</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>function send(address to, uint amount) external {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    payable(to).transfer(amount); // Slither: 任意ETH发送</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 3. unprotected-upgrade: 升级函数缺少权限检查</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>function upgradeTo(address newImpl) external {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    _setImplementation(newImpl); // Slither: 未保护的升级</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"自定义检测器开发\">自定义检测器开发</h3><p>Slither 的 Python API 允许开发者针对项目特定的安全规则编写检测器：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"from slither.detectors.abstract_detector import AbstractDetector, DetectorClassification&#10;from slither.core.declarations import Function&#10;&#10;class MissingEmitDetector(AbstractDetector):&#10;    ARGUMENT = &quot;missing-emit&quot;&#10;    HELP = &quot;State-changing function without event emission&quot;&#10;    IMPACT = DetectorClassification.LOW&#10;    CONFIDENCE = DetectorClassification.HIGH&#10;&#10;    def _detect(self):&#10;        results = []&#10;        for contract in self.compilation_unit.contracts_derived:&#10;            for func in contract.functions:&#10;                if func.is_constructor or func.view or func.pure:&#10;                    continue&#10;                if func.state_variables_written and not func.events_emitted:&#10;                    info = [func, &quot; modifies state but emits no event\\n&quot;]&#10;                    results.append(self.generate_result(info))&#10;        return results\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> slither.detectors.abstract_detector </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> AbstractDetector, DetectorClassification</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> slither.core.declarations </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Function</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">class</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> MissingEmitDetector</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">AbstractDetector</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    ARGUMENT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"missing-emit\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    HELP</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"State-changing function without event emission\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    IMPACT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> DetectorClassification.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">LOW</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    CONFIDENCE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> DetectorClassification.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">HIGH</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> _detect</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        results </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> []</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> contract </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.compilation_unit.contracts_derived:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">            for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> func </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> contract.functions:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">                if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> func.is_constructor </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">or</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> func.view </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">or</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> func.pure:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">                    continue</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">                if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> func.state_variables_written </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">and</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> not</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> func.events_emitted:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">                    info </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [func, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\" modifies state but emits no event</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\\n</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">                    results.append(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.generate_result(info))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> results</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"mythril-符号执行\">Mythril 符号执行</h2><p>Mythril 通过符号执行探索合约的所有可能执行路径，对每条路径上的安全属性进行验证。它不依赖模式匹配，而是在数学层面证明某条路径是否可达。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"# 安装（推荐 Docker）&#10;docker pull mythril/myth&#10;&#10;# 分析单个合约&#10;myth analyze contracts/Vault.sol --solv 0.8.20&#10;&#10;# 指定分析深度和超时&#10;myth analyze contracts/Vault.sol \\&#10;  --execution-timeout 300 \\&#10;  --max-depth 50 \\&#10;  --strategy bfs&#10;&#10;# 分析已部署字节码&#10;myth analyze --address 0x1234... --rpc https://eth-mainnet.g.alchemy.com/v2/KEY\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 安装（推荐 Docker）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">docker</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> pull</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> mythril/myth</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 分析单个合约</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">myth</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> analyze</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> contracts/Vault.sol</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --solv</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0.8.20</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 指定分析深度和超时</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">myth</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> analyze</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> contracts/Vault.sol</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  --execution-timeout</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 300</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  --max-depth</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 50</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  --strategy</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> bfs</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 分析已部署字节码</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">myth</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> analyze</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --address</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 0x1234...</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --rpc</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> https://eth-mainnet.g.alchemy.com/v2/KEY</span></span></code></pre></div><p>Mythril 的符号执行过程：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>将输入变量符号化（而非使用具体值）</li>\n<li>沿每个分支维护路径约束（path constraint）</li>\n<li>在每个安全检查点调用 SMT solver（Z3）验证是否存在满足约束的违规输入</li>\n<li>如果 solver 返回 SAT，生成具体的漏洞利用输入</li>\n</ol>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    START[入口点] --&gt; FORK{分支条件}&#10;    FORK --&gt;|true分支| PATH1[路径约束: x &gt; 100]&#10;    FORK --&gt;|false分支| PATH2[路径约束: x &lt;= 100]&#10;    PATH1 --&gt; CHECK1{安全属性检查}&#10;    PATH2 --&gt; CHECK2{安全属性检查}&#10;    CHECK1 --&gt;|约束可满足| VULN[漏洞报告+PoC输入]&#10;    CHECK1 --&gt;|约束不可满足| SAFE1[该路径安全]&#10;    CHECK2 --&gt;|约束可满足| VULN&#10;    CHECK2 --&gt;|约束不可满足| SAFE2[该路径安全]\">flowchart LR\n    START[入口点] --&gt; FORK{分支条件}\n    FORK --&gt;|true分支| PATH1[路径约束: x &gt; 100]\n    FORK --&gt;|false分支| PATH2[路径约束: x &lt;= 100]\n    PATH1 --&gt; CHECK1{安全属性检查}\n    PATH2 --&gt; CHECK2{安全属性检查}\n    CHECK1 --&gt;|约束可满足| VULN[漏洞报告+PoC输入]\n    CHECK1 --&gt;|约束不可满足| SAFE1[该路径安全]\n    CHECK2 --&gt;|约束可满足| VULN\n    CHECK2 --&gt;|约束不可满足| SAFE2[该路径安全]</pre><h2 id=\"工具组合的工程实践\">工具组合的工程实践</h2><p>在实际审计流程中，静态分析工具的使用遵循&quot;快→深→定制&quot;的三层策略：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>阶段</th>\n<th>工具</th>\n<th>目标</th>\n<th>时间预算</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>初筛</td>\n<td>Slither 全量扫描</td>\n<td>捕获低悬果实，建立代码理解</td>\n<td>5分钟</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>深扫</td>\n<td>Mythril 关键路径</td>\n<td>验证 Slither 发现，发现逻辑漏洞</td>\n<td>30-60分钟</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>定制</td>\n<td>Slither 自定义检测器</td>\n<td>针对项目业务规则验证</td>\n<td>按需</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>持续</td>\n<td>CI/CD 集成</td>\n<td>每次提交自动扫描</td>\n<td>自动</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"# GitHub Actions CI 集成示例&#10;name: Security Scan&#10;on: [push, pull_request]&#10;jobs:&#10;  slither:&#10;    runs-on: ubuntu-latest&#10;    steps:&#10;      - uses: actions/checkout@v4&#10;      - uses: crytic/slither-action@v0.4.0&#10;        with:&#10;          sarif: results.sarif&#10;          slither-args: &#39;--filter-paths &quot;test|script&quot; --exclude naming-convention&#39;&#10;      - uses: github/codeql-action/upload-sarif@v3&#10;        with:&#10;          sarif_file: results.sarif\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># GitHub Actions CI 集成示例</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">Security Scan</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">on</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">push</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">pull_request</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">jobs</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  slither</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    runs-on</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">ubuntu-latest</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    steps</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">uses</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">actions/checkout@v4</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">uses</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">crytic/slither-action@v0.4.0</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        with</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          sarif</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">results.sarif</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          slither-args</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'--filter-paths \"test|script\" --exclude naming-convention'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">uses</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">github/codeql-action/upload-sarif@v3</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        with</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          sarif_file</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">results.sarif</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>Slither 速度快、检测器丰富，适合 CI 集成和初步扫描</li>\n<li>Mythril 符号执行精确度高，能生成具体的漏洞利用输入</li>\n<li>两者互补：Slither 覆盖面广但有误报，Mythril 精确但有路径爆炸问题</li>\n<li>自动化工具只能发现约 30-50% 的漏洞，必须与人工审计结合</li>\n<li>CI/CD 集成确保每次代码变更都经过安全扫描</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li><a href=\"dynamic-testing-fuzzing\">动态测试与模糊测试</a>——静态分析之后的下一层检测能力</li>\n<li><a href=\"../../fintech-fundamentals/smart-contracts/security-auditing\">金融科技基础：安全审计</a>——安全审计的入门概述</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"静态分析工具","id":"静态分析工具"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"Slither 深度使用","id":"slither-深度使用"},{"level":3,"text":"关键检测器","id":"关键检测器"},{"level":3,"text":"自定义检测器开发","id":"自定义检测器开发"},{"level":2,"text":"Mythril 符号执行","id":"mythril-符号执行"},{"level":2,"text":"工具组合的工程实践","id":"工具组合的工程实践"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"安全设计模式","url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/smart-contract-security/foundations/security-design-patterns"},"next":{"title":"动态测试与模糊测试","url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/smart-contract-security/auditing/dynamic-testing-fuzzing"}}